# jerkai-mcp environment

# Sensitive. Connection string for a read-only Postgres role (jerkai_mcp_ro,
# DL-2026-07-27-a3) scoped to SELECT on biometric_readings, whoop_workouts
# and sync_runs only — never whoop_tokens, never a write grant. Distinct from
# jerkai's own DATABASE_URL and every other secret it names. Powers
# list_available_metrics' coverage fields (src/db.ts); describe_metric never
# reads it. Provisioned manually against Neon — see AGENTS.md for the
# constraint this narrows and docs/prd/ for how it was provisioned. Never a
# real value in any committed file.
MCP_DATABASE_URL=

# Path to a local checkout of albimartai/jerkai, used by
# scripts/check-vendor-drift.mjs to compare the vendored files against the
# commit pinned in vendor.lock.json, and by scripts/ci/neon-branch.mjs to
# apply jerkai's migrations to a disposable integration-test branch. Relative
# paths resolve from the repo root.
JERKAI_REPO=../jerkai
